Package: ocsrs
Title: Exact Matrix-Free Optimum Contribution Selection
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Adel", "Kaleche", email = "kaleche@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Solves genomic optimum contribution selection exactly: maximise
    genetic gain subject to a cap on the mean coancestry of the next generation,
    with non-negative contributions summing to one (or to one half per sex).
    The active support of the optimum is found by column generation and each
    fixed support is solved in closed form, so the dense n-by-n genomic
    relationship matrix is never formed; kinship products come straight from the
    genotype matrix. PLINK binary panels are read directly.
